# Copy to .dev.vars for `just signals-dev`. Names only; never commit values.
# Producer tokens are added here as their intake routes land.

# Last.fm API key (https://www.last.fm/api/account/create). Without it, listening is not pulled.
LASTFM_API_KEY=
# Optional GitHub token with no scopes (public data only); raises the API rate limit.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
